<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Restore state="False"/><Text>10/19/26: mark every note in this payroll file as paid so New Only leaves it out next time. Runs only after the file is written, so a failed export marks nothing.</Text></Step>
